{
  "why": "One list of cases for the two redaction functions: crates/captain-logs/src/redact.rs (the app's log) and backend/core/captain_search/applog.py (the services' log). Every value here is made up, and plain on purpose (repeated characters), so no scanner takes it for a real key.",
